# Applies to the API project (Root Directory = repository root).
# Keeps the uploaded source small; the function bundle itself is trimmed by
# "excludeFiles" in vercel.json.
#
# NOTE: `frontend/` is deliberately NOT listed here. The frontend is a separate
# Vercel project with Root Directory = frontend, and excluding it at the repo
# root risks starving that build of its own source. vercel.json already keeps
# frontend/** out of the Python function bundle, which is what the size limit
# actually cares about.
tests/
docs/
reports/
data/processed/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
*.png
*.log
